You are right.  I'm afraid a lot of variants can cause typos in their
uses, though.  
"These \acrpl{nmi} are handled by xxx." might look incorrect until you
are well accustomed to those macros.
 
> 
>> To add index annotations for acronyms, use \IXacr{}, \IXacrpl{}, etc.
