> Oh, this is the  list" you mention below, got it.

I'm not that sure the "hierarchical indexing" is really worthwhile
to maintain.  You might have not noticed, IXh{}{} macro can generate
info for either the single-layer or the two-layer indexing depending
to the boolean "indexhier".  We can easily fall back to the single-layer
scheme.

> 
